      "title": "Prospectus Summary",
      "excerpt": "PROSPECTUS SUMMARY \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 5 \u200b \u200b IMPLICATIONS OF BEING A SMALLER REPORTING COMPANY \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 9 \u200b \u200b RISK FACTORS \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 10 \u200b \u200b THE LINCOLN PARK TRANSACTION \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 14 \u200b \u200b USE OF PROCEEDS \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 21 \u200b \u200b MARKET FOR COMMON STOCK AND DIVIDEND POLICY \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 22 \u200b \u200b SELLING STOCKHOLDER \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 23 \u200b \u200b PLAN OF DISTRIBUTION \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 25 \u200b \u200b DESCRIPTION OF COMMON STOCK \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 27 \u200b \u200b LEGAL MATTERS \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 28 \u200b \u200b EXPERTS \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 28 \u200b \u200b WHERE YOU CAN FIND MORE INFORMATION \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 28 \u200b \u200b INFORMATION INCORPORATED BY REFERENCE \u200b \u200b \u200b \u200b 30 \u200b \u200b i Table of Contents \u200b ABOUT THIS PROSPECTUS We have not, and the selling stockholder has not, authorized anyone to provide you with information different from that contained or incorporated by reference in this prospectus or any accompanying prospectus supplement or free writing prospectus, and neither we nor the selling stockholder take any responsibility for any othe",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    },
    {
      "title": "Use of Proceeds",
      "excerpt": "Use of Proceeds We will receive no proceeds from the sale of shares of our common stock by Lincoln Park pursuant to this prospectus. We may receive up to $50,000,000 in aggregate gross proceeds under the Purchase Agreement from any sales of shares of our common stock we make to Lincoln Park pursuant to the Purchase Agreement after the Commencement Date. We intend to use any net proceeds that we receive under the Purchase Agreement for general corporate purposes, which may include advancing the development of Phase\u00a0I of the Kellyton Graphite Plant and our graphite business, developing the Coosa Graphite Deposit, and making additions to our working capital. It is possible that no additional shares will be issued under the Purchase Agreement. See \u201cUse of Proceeds\u201d on page 21 of this prospectus for more information. Stock Exchange Listing Our common stock is listed on the NYSE American under",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    },
    {
      "title": "Risk Factors",
      "excerpt": "Risk Factors Investing in our securities is highly speculative and involves a high degree of risk. You should read and consider carefully the risks described under the heading \u201cRisk Factors\u201d beginning on page 10 of this prospectus and the risk factors that are incorporated by reference into this prospectus from our filings made with the SEC before purchasing our securities. \u200b (1) blacklining:none; The number of shares of common stock is based on 131,374,682 shares outstanding as of November\u00a012, 2026, and excludes, as of November\u00a012, 2026: \u200b \u2022 blacklining:none; 424,826 shares of common stock issuable upon the exercise of outstanding options; \u200b \u2022 blacklining:none; 25,421,690 shares of common stock issuable upon the vesting of outstanding restricted stock\u00a0units; \u200b \u2022 blacklining:none; 775,785 additional shares of common stock reserved for future issuance under our 2013 Omnibus Incentive Plan",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
  ],
